=== ''Java Edition'' ===
{{HistoryTable
|{{HistoryLine|java}}
|{{HistoryLine||1.4.2|dev=12w32a|[[File:Zombie Villager.png|32px]] Added zombie villagers.
|[[File:Baby Zombie Villager.png|20px]] Added baby zombie villagers. 
|5% of [[zombie]]s spawned are zombie villagers, and [[villager]]s now become infected when killed by a [[zombie]]. Infecting a baby villager creates a baby zombie villager, which is faster than a normal zombie and does not age.
|Zombie villagers under the effects of a [[potion of Weakness]] can be cured by using a [[golden apple]] on them.}}
|{{HistoryLine|||dev=12w34a|Zombie villagers now have two new rare [[drop]]s – [[carrot]]s and [[potato]]es.}}
|{{HistoryLine|||dev=12w34b|Zombie villagers can now pick up and equip dropped [[item]]s.<ref>{{tweet|jeb|240381873480687616}}</ref><ref>http://www.reddit.com/r/Minecraft/comments/yrjp8/zombies_can_pick_up_items_from_the_ground_in_the/c5y7uma</ref> 
|If killed, zombie villagers now drop the item they are holding.
|Zombie villagers can now survive in sunlight, if they are wearing a [[helmet]] or a [[pumpkin]].<ref>{{tweet|dinner|243645556872855552}}</ref>}}
|{{HistoryLine|||dev=12w37a|[[File:Zombie Villager with Carved Pumpkin Revision 1.png|32px]] [[File:Zombie Villager with Jack o'Lantern Revision 1.png|32px]] [[File:Baby Zombie Villager with Carved Pumpkin Revision 1.png|x56px]] [[File:Baby Zombie Villager with Jack o'Lantern Revision 1.png|x56px]] On [[wikipedia:Halloween|Halloween]], zombie villagers can now spawn wearing [[pumpkin]]s or [[jack o'lantern]]s.}}
|{{HistoryLine||1.5|dev=13w03a|Zombie villagers are now able to set the [[player]] on [[fire]], if they are on fire and they attack the player.
|Zombie villagers can now call other [[zombie]]s from the nearby area (radius dependent on difficulty) to attack the [[player]], making packs of zombies approach shortly after [[damage|damaging]] the zombie villager.
|Zombie villagers now cause more [[damage]] when their [[health]] is lower.}}
|{{HistoryLine||1.6.1|dev=13w17a|When damaged, zombie villagers now have a low chance to spawn more zombies.}}
|{{HistoryLine|||dev=13w21a|Zombie villager [[damage]] increasing with decreasing health has been removed.}}
|{{HistoryLine|||dev=13w23b|Zombie villager AI and mechanics have been changed – this has now made them much more horde-like.
|Zombie villagers are now able to detect the [[player]] up to 40 [[block]]s.}}
